				"code" : "chat sendMarkdown: 'Following the example given in the page `Molding CSV data — actions, queries and visualizations`, create a Mondrian view in VSPaper with a force-based layout of a three-level graph of a paper, its authors, and their papers. Represent each author as a light blue square with size proportional to the number of authored papers, and with authors initials as the label. Hovering over the author box should show the full author name. Represent papers as light pink circles with their size proportional to the number of authors. Hovering over a paper will show its title. Clicking on a node will navigate to the paper or author.'"
